---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const url = 'https://getretera.com';
const appStoreUrl = 'https://apps.apple.com/us/app/re-tera/id6776045760';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Re_Tera · Omer Bese"
  description="Re_Tera: an insurance policy app that finds the gaps in your coverage, explains them in plain English, and keeps your records ready."
  path="/retera"
>
  <div class="phead reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">retera</div>
    <h1>We investigate your insurance policy before the fire does<span class="d">.</span></h1>
    <p class="sub">We find the gaps, explain them in plain English, and keep your records ready, so you have the receipts when you need them. Live on the App Store.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="body">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        <strong>Investigation.</strong> Upload the policy. Re_Tera cross-checks coverage,
        sublimits, exclusions, and named insured against your state's insurance code and the
        denial tactics in its case library. Every gap names the section that backs it.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Inventory.</strong> Carriers ask for proof on day one of a claim. Re_Tera keeps
        your inventory, receipts, photos, appraisals, and walkthrough video in one place, dated
        before the loss, exportable as PDF. The day a loss happens is the wrong day to start
        hunting for receipts.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Renewal coach.</strong> Carriers add exclusions, reclassify zones, and change
        sublimits at renewal. Re_Tera watches your renewal date, re-investigates the new policy,
        and hands you three specific questions to ask your agent before you sign anything.
      </p>
      <p>
        Re_Tera shipped to the public App Store in June 2026, built native in Swift, iOS first.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="links ctas">
      <a href={appStoreUrl}>Get it on the App Store <span class="ar">&#8599;</span></a>
      <a href={url}>getretera.com <span class="ar">&#8599;</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .body{margin-top:56px}
  .body .prose{max-width:var(--measure)}
  .ctas{margin-top:28px}
</style>
